<odoo noupdate="1">

    <!--
        Who answers "hablar con soporte".

        A group rather than a hardcoded list of administrators, because the
        request was explicit that this can be handed to somebody who is not an
        administrator. Membership of this group is the only thing that decides
        it, and granting it adds the holder to every open support conversation
        (see `_support_sync_agents`), so a new agent starts with the history,
        not with an empty inbox.

        Administrators reach these conversations regardless: `mail`'s own
        `ir_rule_discuss_channel_group_system` gives `base.group_system` full
        access to every channel. This group exists to extend that reach
        WITHOUT handing out system access, which is the whole point.

        noupdate: membership is operational data. Somebody added to the group
        on a Tuesday must not be removed by a module upgrade on a Wednesday.
    -->
    <record id="group_support_agent" model="res.groups">
        <field name="name">Soporte: atender a los visitantes</field>
        <field name="comment">Ve y responde las conversaciones privadas que
            los visitantes abren desde el chat de la web. No da acceso a
            ninguna otra parte del sistema.</field>
    </record>

</odoo>
